op write-tree ~/.config/opencode/skills/rgd-contract-skill (skill/contract-skill@3): SKILL.md, scripts/check.sh*
op write-tree ~/.config/opencode/skills/rgd-contract-agent (agent/contract-agent@1): SKILL.md, memory/README.md, skills/review/SKILL.md local memory, workspace
op write-file ~/.config/opencode/commands/rgd-contract-command.md (workflow/contract-command@1)
op write-file ~/.config/opencode/agents/rgd-contract-agent.md (agent/contract-agent@1)
skip mcp/contract-stdio@2 config_unwritable: both ~/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc and ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json exist; OpenCode reads both, and it is not known which one to change
skip mcp/contract-http@1 config_unwritable: both ~/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc and ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json exist; OpenCode reads both, and it is not known which one to change
skip mcp/contract-secret@1 config_unwritable: both ~/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc and ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json exist; OpenCode reads both, and it is not known which one to change
core:
  + tree ~/.config/opencode/skills/rgd-contract-skill
  + tree ~/.config/opencode/skills/rgd-contract-agent
  + file ~/.config/opencode/commands/rgd-contract-command.md
  + file ~/.config/opencode/agents/rgd-contract-agent.md
